Throw a knife coated with venom, doing 120% damage as nature and inflicting additional effects based on your active vile poisons (as per the Venomous Strike talent):

Numbing Poison - Reduces global speed by 12% for 5 turns.

Insidious Poison - Applies a standard poison that deals [17, 21, 27, 33, 39 (CUN 10-100)] nature damage over 5 turns.

Crippling Poison - Places 1 talents on cooldown for 1 turns.

Leeching Poison - Heals you for [16, 20, 27, 33, 39 (CUN 10-100)].

Volatile Poison - Deals a further [10, 12, 16, 20, 24 (CUN 10-100)] nature damage to foes in a radius 1 ball.

Using this talent puts your Venomous Strike talent on cooldown.
